# Meal planning app

Use pnpm. Product docs live in `.docs/`; navigation for agents is `AGENTS.md`.

## When making changes

- Convex schema changes: regenerate types with `pnpm dev:convex`
- New routes are generated in `src/routeTree.gen.ts`
- Tests sit next to source (`.test.ts` / `.test.tsx`). Patterns are in `.docs/TESTING.md`
- Before finishing: `pnpm types:check`, `pnpm lint`, and `pnpm test`. Coverage: `pnpm test:coverage`
